  "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>歡迎來到櫻花模組，這個融合了竹子、WA和楓樹的模組。</strong></span>\n\n![](https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/XmQ8N1SBjJKhFy6.png)\n\n<span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">這個模組充滿了日式風格，定食、壽司和許多美食應有盡有。</span></span>\n\n<span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">使用你的武士刀和小太刀體驗全新的戰鬥風格，用營火和鍋子進行烹飪。</span>\n\n<span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">手持武士刀的新型災厄村民會在竹林和楓林出現！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">新服裝：和服、浴衣和羽織。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">好好享受吧~</span>\n\n#### **官方預告片：**\n<iframe width=\"634\" height=\"354\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eaTCFOl_YyQ\" title=\"Minecraft Sakura mod official PV\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">截圖：</span></strong></span>\n\n<img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/aoQGLIkAwTb5z9s.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"792\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/g8k9wzsUV7ZBpAn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1114\" height=\"580\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/7N4ioG1OHFQwtb2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/i8OR6hEB2IXyDHA.png\">",
